   3.7945621132338333`*^9}, {3.794562182869905*^9, 3.794562201970059*^9}}],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Because the Solvent entries are described by ",
 ButtonBox["Chemical",
  BaseStyle->"Hyperlink",
  ButtonData->{
    URL["http://reference.wolfram.com/language/ref/entity/Chemical.html"], 
    None},
  ButtonNote->
   "http://reference.wolfram.com/language/ref/entity/Chemical.html"],
 " entities, the properties of those entities can be queries to provide \
access to other indexing schemes, such as the CAS Number of the molecule:"
}], "Text",
