Cell[TextData[{
 "The fitted parameters to this data are about twice the values reported in \
Eqn 16.19 of Zeng ",
 StyleBox["et al.'s ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "paper from which this data was extracted.  However, this does appear to be \
the correct fit for the dataset:"
}], "Text",
