Cell["\<\
A Plot of the fit shows the general trend, although there are number of \
examples for which the polar parameter is set to zero for very weakly polar \
molecules:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.696377005707614*^9, 3.69637702247129*^9}, {
   3.696377225845625*^9, 3.696377236186659*^9}, 3.696377278504891*^9, {
