Cell["\<\
Empirically, Nylon-66 is soluble in phenolic alcohols (such as cresol, and \
phenol), and poor resistance to tetrachlorethane (correctly described by the \
Hanson model), moderate resistance to benzyl alcohol, but  good resistance \
(low solubility) in morpholine and aniline (in disagreement with the Hanson \
model predictions).\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.794507972180921*^9, {3.794508051329651*^9, 3.794508081945114*^9}, {
   3.794508280736951*^9, 3.7945082897681103`*^9}, {3.794508340836268*^9, 
   3.794508385116084*^9}, {3.7945620692737417`*^9, 3.794562075337538*^9}, {
   3.794578347226458*^9, 3.794578355039299*^9}, {3.794578406136717*^9, 
   3.794578488243059*^9}}]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

