Cell["\<\
Zeng W., Du Y., Xue Y., Frisch H.L. (2007) Solubility Parameters. In: Mark \
J.E. (eds) Physical Properties of Polymers Handbook. Springer, New York, NY \
(Table 16.3).  They in turn describe these data as \"Adapted from J. \
Brandrup, E. H. Immergut, and E. A. Grulke, Polymer Handbook, 4th edition, \
John Wiley & Sons, New York (1999).\"\
\>", "Item",
 CellTags->{"Citation", "TemplateCell"}],

